  "title": "Additional Authentication Method types",
  "summary": "We’ve expanded authentication_method.type with two new options: $pop (Proof-of-Personhood): use when verifying a user through PoP providers. Example variants: worldid , brightid , gitcoin_passport , sismo , civic , idena , etc $payment : use when authentication is tied to a payment method or provide…",
